<h1 itemprop="headline">Aether Launcher: A Rust-Native Minecraft Client Built for Up to 100× Performance</h1>
<p class="dek">A native, JVM-free architecture is the core of Aether Launcher’s performance claim. We explain how it works and test the claim against sample benchmark data.</p>
